<div class="drive-data-use-notice">
    <p>Google Drive is optional. You can keep using local characters without connecting.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>File access:</strong> Aurora accesses files it creates or that you authorize for the app.
            It does not get access to everything in your Drive.</li>
        <li><strong>Account information:</strong> Aurora uses your account identifier, email address and available
            display name to identify the connection and keep saves with the correct account.</li>
        <li><strong>Character and session data:</strong> Opening or saving transfers character files, including
            saved notes, portraits, HP, spell slots and resources, directly between this device and Google Drive.
            These saves do not pass through an Idle Handz storage server.</li>
        <li><strong>Local copies:</strong> This device keeps working copies, session data and recovery files.
            Recovery files stay until you remove them. Cloud saves require an explicit save action.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Disconnect removes this installation's connection. It does not delete your Drive or local files,
        or revoke access on other devices. You can separately revoke Aurora's access in your Google Account.</p>
    <p>Continue to Google to choose an account and review its permission request.</p>
</div>
